<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Booking Expired</title>
</head>

<body style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: #f4f4f4; padding: 20px;">

    <div style="max-width: 600px; margin: auto; background: #ffffff; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px;">

        <h2 style="color: #d9534f;">Booking Expired</h2>

        <p>Hi <strong>{{userName}}</strong>,</p>

        <p>Your booking request has expired because payment was not completed within the allowed time window.</p>

        <hr />

        <p><strong>Booking ID:</strong> {{bookingId}}</p>

        <hr />

        <p style="margin-top: 20px;">
            If you still wish to book this property, please create a new booking and complete the payment within 10 minutes.
        </p>

        <p style="margin-top: 30px;">
            Regards,<br/>
            <strong>Haven Booking Team</strong>
        </p>

    </div>

</body>
</html>
